{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plantverk: Perfectly Plantastic Plant Simulator</strong> - a cozy, idle-friendly little plant game, where planting and decorating come together in your own personal little greenhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922410/extras/36266243f13e02333440453a3975f09b.poster.avif?t=1756205852\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922410/extras/36266243f13e02333440453a3975f09b.webm?t=1756205852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922410/extras/36266243f13e02333440453a3975f09b.mp4?t=1756205852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle-friendly Plant Care </strong>- Grow your garden even when you\u2019re away or working on something else. For the less patient, use the time machine to quicken the growth of your crops.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Greenhouse </strong>- Decorate your own little space with unlockable items, and decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based Interactions</strong> - Feeling a little restless? Why not toss a plant across the greenhouse and try to catch it mid-air! And who knows, perhaps the cactus likes to fly?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922410/extras/a7ad453edc1058d5db9b27d926dc4558.poster.avif?t=1756205852\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922410/extras/a7ad453edc1058d5db9b27d926dc4558.webm?t=1756205852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922410/extras/a7ad453edc1058d5db9b27d926dc4558.mp4?t=1756205852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover New Plants </strong>- Unlock more and more different plants as you progress throughout the game, some more peculiar than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-games </strong>- Unlock special rewards and customization options with different mini-games, surely to keep you entertained while you wait for your plants to grow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922410/extras/82f15b58f31d0ffabc7a6ec1144be651.poster.avif?t=1756205852\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922410/extras/82f15b58f31d0ffabc7a6ec1144be651.webm?t=1756205852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922410/extras/82f15b58f31d0ffabc7a6ec1144be651.mp4?t=1756205852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922410?t=1756205852","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922410?t=1756205852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922410/cec0297fed3c402cd8862d6a09138f16626992b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756205852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com